<%- include('./partials/header.ejs')%>  
    <main>
        <p class="intro">Black Ice Tips is the best Rainbow Six Siege Marketplace for all skill levels. Navigate to browsing educational options
            or selling your own tips.
        </p>
        <ul class="accordion">
            <li>
                <label for="first">Why Us? <span>&#x3e;</span></label>
                <input type="radio" name = "accordion" id="first" checked>
                <div class="content">
                    <p>I am a Diamond Rainbow Six Siege player dedicated to the growth within the community. 
                        After examing the resources for players I decided to found a website to where we only sell the
                        highest of quality tips. We also allow the individual to sell their own tips to the community that helped
                        them rank up. 
                    </p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li>
                <label for="second">How Do I Get Started? <span>&#x3e;</span></label>
                <input type="radio" name = "accordion" id="second">
                <div class="content">
                    <p>
                        To get started you can browse our website for tips that you can purchase. 
                        See what categories we have and what tips are available, we additionally allow one-on-one coaching
                        for players that request that product. 
                    </p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li>
                <label for="third">Where Do I Sell?<span>&#x3e;</span></label>
                <input type="radio" name = "accordion" id="third">
                <div class="content">
                    <p>
                        To sell your tips you can go to the sell page and fill out the form. 
                        We will review your tips and if they are of  quality, after taking careful review we will notify you of your status. 
                        You will be paid a percentage of the sale of your tips.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </li>
        </ul>
       
    </main>
<%- include('./partials/footer.ejs') %> 

